          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Freezing 3 got OMEGA BUFFED, so Yuki's ST damage increased alot\nTrickery 3 is also AMAZING for Yuki\nYuki's ST damage got increased ALOT\nIf the build is played well Yuki's ST damage is around 2x it used to be"
